":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふたりがいちばんおちつく〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"山口石塚高井の野球座談会と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大田佐藤もいるってよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなわけで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ネタしゃしんばっかりとらされたポカはごりっぷくです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃーまねにこうぎしたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「え、じゃあこんどからポカ写真とらないけどいい？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていわれたので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それだけはやめてください"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってことで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ネタしゃしんよろこんでこれからもとりますとなりました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんなの〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポカ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"P.S."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日向坂バレー部のゆーちゅーぶはここからみられるよ\nhttps://youtu.be/qipTRYOqYHo"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあみるかみないかは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おひさまにまかせます〜"}],"source":"official"}}